{"title":"Recent News","markdown":{"headingText":"Recent News","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"```{=html}\n<style>\n.hero-flex {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 2.5rem;\n  margin-top: 1.5rem;\n  margin-bottom: 2rem;\n}\n.hero-flex-text {\n  flex: 1;\n  min-width: 0;\n}\n.hero-flex-photo {\n  flex: 0 0 190px;\n  text-align: right;\n  margin-top: 0.6rem;\n}\n.hero-flex-photo img {\n  width: 190px;\n  height: 190px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n  margin-left: auto;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .hero-flex {\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .hero-flex-photo {\n    order: -1;\n    margin: 0 0 1.2rem 0;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .hero-flex-photo img {\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .hero-flex-text {\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"hero-flex\">\n  <div class=\"hero-flex-text\">\n    <h2 style=\"margin-top:0;\">Omid Mirzamohammadi</h2>\n    <h3>About Me</h3>\n    <p>I am a Ph.D. researcher in cryptography at COSIC, KU Leuven, under the supervision of Prof. Bart Preneel, Prof. Dave Singelée, and Dr. Aysajan Abidin. My work focuses on designing cryptographic protocols for privacy-preserving systems.</p>\n    <h3>Research Interests</h3>\n    <p>I am interested in provable security and the formal analysis of cryptographic protocols. My current research focuses on anonymous credentials, privacy threats in decentralized systems, and post-quantum cryptography. I am particularly interested in designing new constructions and rigorously proving their security.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"hero-flex-photo\">\n    <img src=\"images/profile.jpg\" alt=\"Profile photo of Omid Mirzamohammadi\">\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n\n- **September 2026** — Our paper “Multi-Verifier Keyed-Verification Anonymous Credentials” has been accepted to ASIACRYPT 2026. [Read the paper](https://eprint.iacr.org/2025/2156).\n- **Website launched.**\n- **PrivCrypt 2026:** I gave two talks at PrivCrypt 2026, affiliated with Eurocrypt 2026. The slides are available in the [Talks](talks.qmd) section.\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":true,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","css":["styles.scss"],"toc":true,"include-in-header":[{"text":"<meta name=\"google-site-verification\" content=\"QWUq5ZFfFOtqbr4hd6Hg7tow7x8a9vZXhv9hsXJaxR0\" />\n"}],"output-file":"index.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"Table of contents","toc-title-website":"On this page","related-formats-title":"Other Formats","related-notebooks-title":"Notebooks","source-notebooks-prefix":"Source","other-links-title":"Other Links","code-links-tit